{
  "name": "Cabas – import des tickets de caisse",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "postProcessAction": "read",
        "format": "simple",
        "downloadAttachments": true,
        "options": {
          "customEmailConfig": "[\"UNSEEN\", [\"OR\", [\"SUBJECT\", \"ticket\"], [\"SUBJECT\", \"facture\"]]]"
        }
      },
      "id": "0b6f2c1a-1d7e-4a51-9c3e-6a0c5f1a0001",
      "name": "Mail de ticket reçu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "notes": "Choisissez votre compte IMAP (Gmail : imap.gmail.com, mot de passe d'application). Adaptez le filtre : ici les mails non lus dont le sujet contient « ticket » ou « facture ». Exemple par expéditeur : [\"UNSEEN\", [\"FROM\", \"leclerc\"]]"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6f1d2b0e-3c1a-4f7a-8f0b-2b3c4d5e6f01",
              "leftValue": "={{ Object.keys($binary ?? {}).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gt" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0b6f2c1a-1d7e-4a51-9c3e-6a0c5f1a0002",
      "name": "Pièce jointe ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://courses.mondomaine.fr/api/webhooks/receipt",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "name": "file", "inputDataFieldName": "attachment_0" },
            { "name": "store", "value": "={{ $('Mail de ticket reçu').item.json.from }}" },
            { "name": "source", "value": "email" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "timeout": 120000 }
      },
      "id": "0b6f2c1a-1d7e-4a51-9c3e-6a0c5f1a0003",
      "name": "Envoyer le PDF / la photo à Cabas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, 200],
      "notes": "Remplacez l'URL par celle de votre Cabas. Identifiant « Header Auth » : nom Authorization, valeur Bearer <token du foyer> (Réglages › Foyer)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://courses.mondomaine.fr/api/webhooks/receipt",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ store: $json.from, source: 'email', rawText: $json.textPlain || $json.text || $json.textHtml }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 60000 }
      },
      "id": "0b6f2c1a-1d7e-4a51-9c3e-6a0c5f1a0004",
      "name": "Envoyer le texte du mail à Cabas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [500, 400],
      "notes": "Pour les enseignes qui envoient le ticket dans le corps du mail (HTML) plutôt qu'en pièce jointe."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Mail de ticket reçu": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Pièce jointe ?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Pièce jointe ?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Envoyer le PDF / la photo à Cabas", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Envoyer le texte du mail à Cabas", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": { "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false }
}
